    "text": "1 days ago A man who targeted victims with online scams in at least four states was arrested this month, the Nassau County Sheriff’s Office said. David Gene Ford, 59, was charged with grand theft, organized fraud, and writing false checks following an investigation into an alleged scheme involving fraudulent checks and the purchase of high-value items. Read full article",
